OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FShowers and
OL,6,Fstrong winds in the north ease
OL,7,Fovernight, with many places dry. Rain
OL,8,Fand strengthening winds reach the
OL,9,Fsouthwest later. Chilly for some, with
OL,10,Fpatchy frost possible further north.
OL,11,
OL,12,CMonday:FRain sweeps northeast across
OL,13,Fthe UK, with strengthening winds
OL,14,Fbringing gales in the west later.
OL,15,FAfter a cold start for some, it will
OL,16,Ffeel increasingly mild from the west.
